special_abilities:
  - name: "Tsunami Full Conversion Body"
    description: "The AT-C9000 Tsunami, a heavy assault full conversion cyborg built by ArmaTech for the Republic''s military and police: a winged, tailed draconic body 10 feet (3 m) tall standing straight, usually stooped to 7-8 feet, 16 feet long with the tail, 1200 lbs (540 kg). Nuclear powered, average life 20 years. M.D.C. by location: hands (2) 17 each*, left arm 50, right weapon arm 60, legs (2) 120 each, tail/particle beam cannon 70*, folding wings (2) 100 each, head/neck 100 (reinforced), jet thruster/mini-missile launcher on the back 80*, ten tiny maneuvering thrusters 5 each*, main body 320 (stored). * A called shot at -3 to strike. The armor is built in and no additional body armor can be worn. Destroying the head kills the character; depleting the main body leaves the brain alive on emergency systems for 36 hours, and 125 points below zero destroys it beyond recovery."
  - name: "Movement: Run, Leap and Jet Pack"
    description: "Runs at 120 mph (Spd 176). Leaps 25 feet (7.6 m) high or lengthwise, and a running leap adds 1D4x10 yards/meters. Flies only by its built-in jet pack: 100 mph maximum, for twelve hours at top speed before the pack must cool down, indefinitely with rest stops at 80 mph or less. The folding wings allow gliding and give +10% to jet pack piloting; if one or both wings are destroyed the ''borg can still fly on the pack, at -20% to the piloting skill."
  - name: "Tail: Striking Tail and Particle Beam"
    description: "The tail is too stiff to grab things but strikes for 6D6 S.D.C. (half on a restrained strike), or 2D4 M.D. with the vibro-blade at its tip; reach 6 feet. A particle beam gun on the tip fires 5D6 M.D., range 1,000 feet (305 m), effectively unlimited payload. Attacks equal the character''s hand to hand attacks."
  - name: "Right Arm: Mini-Gun and Vibro-Axe"
    description: "In place of a right hand, a high-capacity mini-gun firing explosive rounds, fed from an ammo canister filling the rest of the arm. Bursts only: 20 rounds for 1D4x10 M.D., range 2,000 feet (610 m), 1,000 rounds (fifty bursts) in the canister. A vibro-axe below the gun does 4D6 M.D. in close combat. Rate of fire equals the character''s hand to hand attacks."
  - name: "Mini-Missiles"
    description: "Two mini-missiles on top of the back-mounted jet thruster, for enemy aircraft and monsters. Damage by missile type, fired one at a time or as a volley of two, range about one mile."
  - name: "Laser Eyes"
    description: "Two short-ranged laser beamers beside the multi-optic eyes: 2D6 M.D. per single beam, 4D6 M.D. for the simultaneous double blast they normally fire, range 1,000 feet (305 m), effectively unlimited payload, rate of fire equal to the hand to hand attacks. More than 20 M.D.C. of damage to the head disables one; 40 or more disables both."
  - name: "Concealed Leg Compartments"
    description: "Two concealed compartments in each leg. One holds a vibro-blade dagger (or stun stick or laser rod) and a pair of stun/flash grenades; the other typically two extra E-clips and an RMK medical kit for use on others."
  - name: "Bionic Hand to Hand"
    description: "Mega-damage hand to hand combat, although the cyborg''s physical strength is S.D.C. based except for special attacks like the power punch. Restrained punch 1D6+13 S.D.C., full strength punch 3D6+13 S.D.C., power punch 1D4 M.D. (two attacks), head butt 2D6 S.D.C., kick 4D6+13 S.D.C., jump kick/leap attack 2D4 M.D. (two attacks), judo style throw/flip 3D6 S.D.C., full speed ram/body block 1D4 M.D. (two attacks). The stored +1 attack (tail), +2 initiative, +2 parry, +1 dodge, +2 pull punch, +1 roll and +2 save vs horror factor are the body''s; the +4 strike, parry and dodge the book adds for P.P. 23 comes from the stored P.P."
  - name: "Standard Bionic Features"
    description: "Bionic lung with gas filter and oxygen storage cell, built-in language translator, built-in loudspeaker, built-in radio receiver and transmitter, concealed climb cord, clock calendar, a concealed compartment in each leg, gyro-compass, modulating voice synthesizer, multi-optic eyes, psionic electromagnetic dampers, universal headjack with amplified hearing and sound filtration, universal handjack, the striking tail with its particle beam, folding wings, and a sensor system equal to a Sensor Hand built into the head."
side_effects: "INHUMAN SHAPE. After one year of service there is a 2% chance of mental trauma (roll on the Random Insanity Table), rising by 1% each further year. On that table Neurosis becomes Delusion: believes he is a dragon, greets true dragons and dragon-like beings as brothers, and stays friendly toward humanity; Fear of Animals becomes Fear/Hatred of Dragons: attacks unknown dragons on sight unless warned and convinced otherwise, and stays wary of all dragons and dragon-like creatures. Most Tsunami ''borgs never suffer it."
